<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA V SOUTH AFRICA ONE-DAY SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA V SOUTH AFRICA ONE-DAY SCOREBOARD.</headline>
